(5606090, 810908, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off to me as a highly processed snapshot, I''m afraid. You also should use the full 640 pixels allowed and less compression. At an 80k filesize, you had a lot more overhead available to try and squeeze some more image quality out of this. Compression kills detail.</td>', 'Comes off to me as a highly processed snapshot, I''m afraid. You also should use the full 640 pixels allowed and less compression. At an 80k filesize, you had a lot more overhead available to try and squeeze some more image quality out of this. Compression kills detail.', '2009-08-10 14:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5606091, 810985, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition. Not sure how it will do with the voting crowd here as it is not eye grabbing, but I feel it''s a good effort and something different that deserves a decent vote.</td>', 'An interesting composition. Not sure how it will do with the voting crowd here as it is not eye grabbing, but I feel it''s a good effort and something different that deserves a decent vote.', '2009-08-10 14:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
