(5606099, 811913, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it, very different. It seems a bit soft in appearance for what looks like concrete. Your file size of 92k indicates you may have used more compression than youhad to. compression kills detail. Always use the least amount you can and still fit in under the challenge limit.</td>', 'I like it, very different. It seems a bit soft in appearance for what looks like concrete. Your file size of 92k indicates you may have used more compression than youhad to. compression kills detail. Always use the least amount you can and still fit in under the challenge limit.', '2009-08-10 14:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
