(5606796, 812021, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but I see quite a bit of artifacts. Mostly visible in the plants, but I can see some in the stone as well. The result of comrpession. Though not an extremely small image, at 121k, you did have a bit more overhead to try and avoid some of the artifacts. Fitting this much detail into a 640 pixel image is tough however, and even at the full 150k challenge limit, you may have had some.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but I see quite a bit of artifacts. Mostly visible in the plants, but I can see some in the stone as well. The result of comrpession. Though not an extremely small image, at 121k, you did have a bit more overhead to try and avoid some of the artifacts. Fitting this much detail into a 640 pixel image is tough however, and even at the full 150k challenge limit, you may have had some.', '2009-08-10 22:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
