(5608431, 810740, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sosigene:</b></div><hr/><i> And it seems clear that is is not enough to have a clever idea or a funny title to perform well at DPC. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>There are other rewards for a clever idea, such as my shoehorn for injecting a little humor into a non-humorous challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737194" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737194.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>And a high 4 is a normal first time score for many of us. Welcome to the madhouse!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-12 00:51:41.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Sosigene: And it seems clear that is is not enough to have a clever idea or a funny title to perform well at DPC. ;)  There are other rewards for a clever idea, such as my shoehorn for injecting a little humor into a non-humorous challenge.  And a high 4 is a normal first time score for many of us. Welcome to the madhouse!', '2009-08-12 01:50:34.000000', '2009-08-12 01:51:41.000000', 0),
