(5608586, 811877, 49109, '<td valign="top">I loved this image and hoped it would ribbon, but I guess you know you went too far with the huge white area. I thought it was in the picture itself.</td>', 'I loved this image and hoped it would ribbon, but I guess you know you went too far with the huge white area. I thought it was in the picture itself.', '2009-08-12 03:42:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5608587, 811953, 54645, '<td valign="top">OK, so Lydia was a bit off! She''s a bit tired this week! ;)  I suspect that many, including myself, did not see the squares as the subject given your title and placement of the queen in the composition. Anyway, the mirror adds the perspective from the other player, I like that aspect of the image.</td>', 'OK, so Lydia was a bit off! She''s a bit tired this week! ;)  I suspect that many, including myself, did not see the squares as the subject given your title and placement of the queen in the composition. Anyway, the mirror adds the perspective from the other player, I like that aspect of the image.', '2009-08-12 03:45:03.000000', NULL, 0),
