(5611685, 810738, 99981, '<td valign="top"><strike>Hi, congrats for this nice score. I''m sorry, but can you tell me how you did the square bokeh?</strike> <br/> <br/>Ah, ok..i saw it! Great, really great idea!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-14 11:46:03.</i></td>', 'Hi, congrats for this nice score. I''m sorry, but can you tell me how you did the square bokeh?  Ah, ok..i saw it! Great, really great idea!', '2009-08-14 12:45:20.000000', '2009-08-14 12:46:03.000000', 0),
