(5614094, 812043, 67145, '<td valign="top">OUCH .. !!<br/>i looked and looked and couldnt work out how that square could possibly be there .. !!<br/>then noticed your reply to ben''s comment .. its such a clever and different take on the challenge .. totally fits as well .. <br/>also an interesting breakdown of votes .. <br/>anyhooooo .. came to see wot amazing art you''ve been creating lately and noticed 8% on your profile page .. thought my eyes were playing tricks on me at first .. <br/>hope all''s well in your world nick .. <br/>caught any big''uns lately .. lol .. !!..:)<br/> <br/>ps.  i noticed a few brilliant thumbs on your profile page but i''m too buggared to comment right now .. <br/>bought a 2tb western digital a few weeks ago to put all my stuff on so its all backed up and did my first sync yesterday .. two worked perfectly then last night i decided to do my working external disc that has all my dpc, family and work stuff on it .. over 100gb of stuff .. <br/>it was taking a lot longer than it should and this morning i realised it had copied the stuff it was synchronising .. other stuff was pretty annoying too .. anyway .. maybe not the place to write all this but as i said i''m buggared and couldnt be bothered going back to your profile page and sending a pm .. <br/>but the reason i''m buggard is that last night i got up about 6 times to check on the progress of the sync .. thinking it should be finished .. the fact that it wasnt made sleep difficult .. you know with the worry .. <br/>by the way i''m sleeping heaps better than i used to .. <br/>:)<br/>i just read that back to myself .. hope you have a better time understanding it than i just did .. !!<br/> <br/></td>', 'OUCH .. !!i looked and looked and couldnt work out how that square could possibly be there .. !!then noticed your reply to ben''s comment .. its such a clever and different take on the challenge .. totally fits as well .. also an interesting breakdown of votes .. anyhooooo .. came to see wot amazing art you''ve been creating lately and noticed 8% on your profile page .. thought my eyes were playing tricks on me at first .. hope all''s well in your world nick .. caught any big''uns lately .. lol .. !!..:) ps.  i noticed a few brilliant thumbs on your profile page but i''m too buggared to comment right now .. bought a 2tb western digital a few weeks ago to put all my stuff on so its all backed up and did my first sync yesterday .. two worked perfectly then last night i decided to do my working external disc that has all my dpc, family and work stuff on it .. over 100gb of stuff .. it was taking a lot longer than it should and this morning i realised it had copied the stuff it was synchronising .. other stuff was pretty annoying too .. anyway .. maybe not the place to write all this but as i said i''m buggared and couldnt be bothered going back to your profile page and sending a pm .. but the reason i''m buggard is that last night i got up about 6 times to check on the progress of the sync .. thinking it should be finished .. the fact that it wasnt made sleep difficult .. you know with the worry .. by the way i''m sleeping heaps better than i used to .. :)i just read that back to myself .. hope you have a better time understanding it than i just did .. !! ', '2009-08-17 08:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
